  * [Standalone] The Nginx configuration template has been cleaned up. It is now significantly easier to edit the Nginx configuration template without breaking compatibility with future versions."}<_**next**_>{"sha": "6da59c28651bca4fc171b68134912c3036682261", "filename": "src/agent/Core/Controller/SendRequest.cpp", "status": "modified", "additions": 39, "deletions": 6, "changes": 45, "blob_url": "https://github.com/phusion/passenger/blob/ddb8ecc4ebf260e4967f57f271d4f5761abeac3e/src/agent/Core/Controller/SendRequest.cpp", "raw_url": "https://github.com/phusion/passenger/raw/ddb8ecc4ebf260e4967f57f271d4f5761abeac3e/src/agent/Core/Controller/SendRequest.cpp", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/phusion/passenger/contents/src/agent/Core/Controller/SendRequest.cpp?ref=ddb8ecc4ebf260e4967f57f271d4f5761abeac3e", "patch": "@@ -204,6 +204,33 @@ Controller::sendBodyToAppWhenAppSinkIdle(Channel *_channel, unsigned int size) {
