{"sha": "8920376b4d207f4e5337a626ce69481d2cb7c650", "filename": "NEWS", "status": "modified", "additions": 6, "deletions": 0, "changes": 6, "blob_url": "https://github.com/php/php-src/blob/1a23ebc1fff59bf480ca92963b36eba5c1b904c4/NEWS", "raw_url": "https://github.com/php/php-src/raw/1a23ebc1fff59bf480ca92963b36eba5c1b904c4/NEWS", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/contents/NEWS?ref=1a23ebc1fff59bf480ca92963b36eba5c1b904c4", "patch": "@@ -52,6 +52,12 @@ PHP                                                                        NEWS
   . Fixed bug #74669 (Unserialize ArrayIterator broken). (Andrew Nester)
   . Fixed bug #75015 (Crash in recursive iterator destructors). (Julien)

+- Standard:
+  . Fixed bug #74103 (heap-use-after-free when unserializing invalid array
+    size). (Nikita)
+  . Fixed bug #75054 (A Denial of Service Vulnerability was found when
+    performing deserialization). (Nikita)
+
 - XMLRPC:
   . Fixed bug #74975 (Incorrect xmlrpc serialization for classes with declared
     properties). (blar)"}<_**next**_>{"sha": "3d474b31b1cde8659070737d5ce8d1551fb34c88", "filename": "ext/standard/tests/serialize/bug74103.phpt", "status": "added", "additions": 9, "deletions": 0, "changes": 9, "blob_url": "https://github.com/php/php-src/blob/1a23ebc1fff59bf480ca92963b36eba5c1b904c4/ext/standard/tests/serialize/bug74103.phpt", "raw_url": "https://github.com/php/php-src/raw/1a23ebc1fff59bf480ca92963b36eba5c1b904c4/ext/standard/tests/serialize/bug74103.phpt", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/contents/ext/standard/tests/serialize/bug74103.phpt?ref=1a23ebc1fff59bf480ca92963b36eba5c1b904c4", "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
