 ## Open Source Projects that use Leptonica ##
-  * [php](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PHP)  (scripting language for dynamic web pages)
   * [tesseract](https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract/) (optical character recognition)
