+  * Fixed:
+      Out-of-bounds read in uriParse*Ex* for incomplete URIs with IPv6
+      addresses with embedded IPv4 address, e.g. "//[::44.1";
+      mitigated if passed parameter <afterLast> points to readable memory
+      containing a '\0' byte.
