{"sha": "41da0602114ca92c4db9611178e542521d8957e3", "filename": "ChangeLog.md", "status": "modified", "additions": 5, "deletions": 0, "changes": 5, "blob_url": "https://github.com/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo/blob/9c78a04df4e44ef6487eee99c4258397f4fdca55/ChangeLog.md", "raw_url": "https://github.com/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo/raw/9c78a04df4e44ef6487eee99c4258397f4fdca55/ChangeLog.md", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo/contents/ChangeLog.md?ref=9c78a04df4e44ef6487eee99c4258397f4fdca55", "patch": "@@ -47,6 +47,11 @@ a 4:2:2 or 4:2:0 JPEG image using the merged (non-fancy) upsampling algorithms
 7. The new CMake-based build system will now disable the MIPS DSPr2 SIMD
 extensions if it detects that the compiler does not support DSPr2 instructions.

+8. Fixed out-of-bounds read in cjpeg that occurred when attempting to compress
+a specially-crafted malformed color-index (8-bit-per-sample) BMP file in which
+some of the samples (color indices) exceeded the bounds of the BMP file's color
+table.
+

