+
+        Web Inspector: init front-end UI upon DOMContentLoaded, not load event.
+        https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=49596
+
+        * inspector/front-end/inspector.js:
+        (windowLoaded):
+
 2010-11-15  Alexander Pavlov  <apavlov@chromium.org>

