+2011-06-02  Joone Hur  <joone.hur@collabora.co.uk>
+
+        Reviewed by Martin Robinson.
+
+        [GTK] Only load dictionaries if spell check is enabled
+        https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=32879
+
