+        * webkit/webkitwebview.cpp:
+        (webkit_web_view_update_settings): Skip loading dictionaries when enable-spell-checking is false. 
+        (webkit_web_view_settings_notify): Ditto.
+
 2011-06-01  Xan Lopez  <xlopez@igalia.com>

