commit_message:
Add string resources for MD Ash network detailed view

Includes messages for when:
 - a network connection is connecting;
 - a network connection is connected;
 - a cellular network is not activated;
 - a VPN network may be monitored.
Also includes the title for cellular section.

BUG=none
TEST=

